    "updated_at": "2025-05-19T14:51:37Z",
    "body": "The code I'm updating in chromium for the new qualified name parsing rules also affects createDocumentType(), so I'm in favor of updating that method to use the new parsing rules so I don't have to special case it to use the old parsing rules.\n\ncreateProcessingInstruction I'm less sure what to do about.",
