    "updated_at": "2025-05-20T02:30:26Z",
    "body": "From what I can tell reading https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#doctype-state a definition of \"valid doctype name\" that matches the HTML parser would be something like:\n\n- If _name_ contains NUL, ASCII whitespace, or &gt;, then return false.\n- Otherwise, return true.\n\nSome [testing](https://jsbin.com/piveqimida/1/edit?html,js,console) seems to bear this out.\n\nShould we roll that into #1079 too?",
